OL,3,GNEWSA'Replenished reservoirs' and      
OL,4,A'landmark cases'                       
OL,6,FHere's our weekly round up of stories  
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West 
OL,8,Fof England.                            
OL,10,FJoanne Young says she will "never feel 
OL,11,Fcompletely safe" after four men were   
OL,12,Fconvicted of sexually abusing her      
OL,13,Ffollowing years of drugging, rape and  
OL,14,Fonline exploitation orchestrated by her
OL,15,Fex-husband at their home in Swindon.   
OL,17,FEllen Roome, who campaigned for legal  
OL,18,Freforms to give parents access to      
OL,19,Fchildren's social media accounts after 
OL,20,Ftheir death, has been awarded an       
OL,21,Fhonorary doctorate by the University of
OL,22,FGloucestershire.                       
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
