OL,3,GNEWSA'Replenished reservoirs' and      
OL,4,A'landmark cases'                       
OL,6,FAn Easyjet passenger plane was forced  
OL,7,Fto make an emergency landing at Bristol
OL,8,FAirport after it was struck by a bird  
OL,9,Fduring take-off. Nobody was hurt in the
OL,10,Fincident.                              
